---
subject: <%= it.inviterName %> invited you to join <%= it.orgName %> on <%= it.appName %>
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #09090b;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px;">You've been invited</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px;">
    <strong><%= it.inviterName %></strong> has invited you to join
    <strong><%= it.orgName %></strong> on <%= it.appName %><% if (it.role) { %>
    as <strong><%= it.role %></strong><% } %>.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= it.url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">Accept invitation</a>
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; line-height: 1.5; margin: 16px 0 0;">
    If the button doesn't work, paste this URL into your browser:<br>
    <a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all;"><%= it.url %></a>
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; margin: 24px 0 0;">
    If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
===TEXT===
You've been invited to <%= it.orgName %>

<%= it.inviterName %> has invited you to join <%= it.orgName %> on
<%= it.appName %><% if (it.role) { %> as <%= it.role %><% } %>.

Accept the invitation by opening the link below:

  <%= it.url %>

If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.
